<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Locate Person</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 20), Druid (guild level 37)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast locate person &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Gives you a sense of where someone is: you see them, and the room they are 
in. It looks in your own area first, and then in the whole world. It only 
finds people and other humanoids, not animals or monsters of other kinds.
</p><p>If the spell fails, you feel confused; if it fails badly, the one you looked 
for realizes that you tried to locate them. To find the way there, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Find Path</a>. You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Find Path</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate Object</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>